{%- comment -%}
Black Friday: the "bundles to go with it" list inside the player card (offer for everyone) in sections/black-friday-code.
Accepts: bundles (array of products, the Audiobooks Bundle products from cfg.bundles_collection, cheapest first),
pct (the bundle % off, display only: the discount itself is "Black Friday: 25% off the Black Friday bundles" in Shopify),
uid. Prices and the % sit in [data-bf-veil], so they blur with the player price until the reveal date.
Discounted price is rounded the way Shopify rounds the discount amount (to the penny), so it matches the basket.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if bundles.size > 0 -%}
<div class="bf-bundles" aria-labelledby="bf-bundles-{{ uid }}">
  <p class="bf-bundles__title" id="bf-bundles-{{ uid }}">Plus <span data-bf-veil>{{ pct }}%</span> off {{ bundles.size }} new audiobook bundles</p>
  <ul class="bf-bundles__list" role="list">
    {%- for b in bundles -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign was = b.price
        assign cut = was | times: pct | divided_by: 100.0 | round
        assign now = was | minus: cut
        assign lo = b.metafields.book.age_lower.value
        assign hi = b.metafields.book.age_upper.value
        assign name = b.title | remove: ' Audiobook Bundle'
      -%}
      <li>
        <a class="bf-bundle" href="{{ b.url }}" data-vs-track="bf_bundle">
          {%- if b.featured_image -%}
            {{ b.featured_image | image_url: width: 160 | image_tag: class: 'bf-bundle__img', loading: 'lazy', widths: '80, 160', sizes: '64px', alt: '' }}
          {%- endif -%}
          <span class="bf-bundle__text">
            <span class="bf-bundle__name">{{ name | escape }}</span>
            {%- if lo != blank -%}<span class="bf-bundle__age">{% if lo >= 10 %}Ages {{ lo }}+{% elsif hi != blank %}Ages {{ lo }}–{{ hi }}{% else %}Ages {{ lo }}+{% endif %} · 3 audiobooks</span>{%- endif -%}
          </span>
          <span class="bf-bundle__price" data-bf-veil><span class="bf-bundle__now">{{ now | money }}</span><s class="bf-bundle__was">{{ was | money }}</s></span>
        </a>
      </li>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
</div>
{%- endif -%}
